# Agent-emitted artifacts (research/plan/spec markdown rendered by
# emit_* tools). In Docker e2e/smoke runs these land in the
# agentic-artifacts named volume; out-of-Docker local-dev runs use
# CWD-relative .artifacts/ defaults (see cmd/semteams/tools/emit*).
# Either path keeps the host checkout clean of generated content.
.artifacts/

# Legacy emit-tool output dirs (pre-ADR-041 default was docs/X).
# Ignored to prevent further leaks; existing committed files are
# being deleted alongside the default switch.
/docs/specs/
/docs/research/
/docs/plans/
